# CR157 weekly Room retrospective — committed per-cycle evidence lives here:
# the in-session E1–E5 post-mortem of each week's misses digest (CR143
# taxonomy), plus any scored lines it cites. The raw weekly batch outputs
# (report_<week>.md / scored_<week>.jsonl / misses_<week>.jsonl) are written
# by scripts/weekly_room_retro.py on melehost under
# /backtest_results/weekly_retro/ and stay there — copy in only what a
# post-mortem needs. Mirrors CR164_room_backtest/results/.
